# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout across every platform. The skill
# launcher (skills/pptfast/scripts/run.sh) is the reason this matters: a
# checkout that converts it to CRLF ships a shell script no POSIX shell can
# run, and the failure looks like a broken skill rather than a line ending.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Image assets are binary and must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
